    "Context Engineering" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情境工程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Context Engineering Tips" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情境工程小技巧"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Context engineering is the art and science of providing just the right information to an AI model for the best results. It goes beyond simple prompt writing—focusing on how to structure, prune, and optimize all the information (context) you give to the model. By applying context engineering, you can make your prompts clearer, more effective, and more efficient." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "情境工程是一門為 AI 模型提供恰到好處資訊、以取得最佳結果的藝術與科學。它不只是撰寫提示詞，而是著重於如何組織、精簡並最佳化你提供給模型的所有資訊（情境）。善用情境工程，能讓你的提示詞更清楚、更有效，也更有效率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
