          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vibe 提示詞（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vibe prompts you favorite will appear here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入最愛的 Vibe 提示詞會顯示在這裡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vibrate" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "震動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome, Premium user!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歡迎，進階版使用者！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing effective prompts is key to getting the best results from AI models. Here are some best practices, along with the rules our app uses to analyze your prompts:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "撰寫有效的提示詞，是從 AI 模型取得最佳結果的關鍵。以下是一些最佳實踐，以及本 App 分析提示詞時使用的規則："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are now Premium user!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已成為進階版使用者！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have no favorite prompts yet. Try all prompts instead?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你還沒有最愛的提示詞，要改從所有提示詞中挑選嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're All Set!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就緒！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your purchase funds the new prompts we keep adding to the library." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的購買將支持我們持續為資料庫加入新的提示詞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "v%@  Check for Updates" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "v%@  檢查更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is copied and ready to paste." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」已拷貝，可以直接貼上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• %@: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• %1$@：%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Add detail: Clarify who, what, how, when, and where if needed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 補充細節：必要時說明誰、什麼、如何、何時、何地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Add only what the model demonstrably lacks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 只補充模型確實缺少的資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Be clear and specific about the app or use case." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 清楚具體地描述 App 或使用情境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Be clear and specific about the task." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 清楚具體地描述任務。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Be specific: Avoid vague words like 'things' or 'stuff'." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 具體明確：避免使用「東西」、「那些」等模糊字詞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Break complex tasks into steps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 將複雜任務拆成步驟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Checks for missing details in long prompts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 檢查長提示詞是否缺少細節。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Detects repeated or redundant sentences." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 偵測重複或多餘的句子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Encourages clear instructions or questions, especially for short prompts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 鼓勵使用明確的指令或問題，尤其是短提示詞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Flags vague or generic wording." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 標示模糊或籠統的用詞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Include only necessary information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 只包含必要的資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Keep it concise: Remove filler and redundant information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 保持簡潔：刪除贅字與多餘資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Looks for examples in long prompts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 檢查長提示詞是否包含範例。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Make your prompt a clear instruction or question." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 讓提示詞成為明確的指令或問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Provide examples: Add sample outputs or clarifications." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 提供範例：加入範例輸出或補充說明。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Prune irrelevant or redundant information." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 刪除無關或重複的資訊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Recommends breaking down complex tasks into steps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 建議將複雜任務拆成步驟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Specify output: Indicate the desired format (e.g., JSON, list)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 指定輸出：說明想要的格式（例如 JSON、清單）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Start with the fundamental context needed for the task." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 從任務所需的基本情境開始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• State your audience: Mention if the response should be for beginners, experts, etc." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 說明目標讀者：註明回答是給初學者、專家或其他對象。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Suggests adding structure for lengthy instructions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 建議為冗長的指示加入結構。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Suggests specifying output format and audience." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 建議指定輸出格式與目標讀者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Use neutral language: Avoid leading or biased phrases." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 使用中立語言：避免引導性或帶有偏見的用語。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Use structure (lists, JSON, etc.) for clarity." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 使用結構（清單、JSON 等）讓內容更清楚。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Use structure: Break complex tasks into steps or lists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 使用結構：將複雜任務拆成步驟或清單。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Warns if prompts are too long or contain filler words." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 提示詞過長或含有贅字時發出提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
